1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jos%C3%A9_Mouzinho José Mouzinho d'Albuquerque]''' was a Portuguese horse rider. He competed in the 1924 Summer Olympics and in the 1928 Summer Olympics.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1924, Mouzinho and his horse Hetrugo won the '''bronze medal''' as part of the Portuguese show jumping team, after finishing 17th in the individual jumping competition.
2 CONT
2 CONT Four years later, he and his horse Hebraico finished sixth as part of the Portuguese show jumping team, after finishing 19th in the individual jumping competition.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Olympic Medal Record==
2 CONT
2 CONT Bronze - 1924 Paris - Team jumping (Men's Equestrian)
