0 @I6000000013789756780@ INDI
1 NAME Susannah /Vaughton/
2 GIVN Susannah
2 SURN Vaughton
2 _MARNM Latham
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 JAN 1724
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1754
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When her husband Thomas died in 1750 (aged 35), he had left the family "in low circumstances with four children which she was not able to provide for".
2 CONT
2 CONT She "petitioned" that Thomas be "admitted" to Christ's Hospital School, "to be educated and brought up among other poor children". He was 8 at the time and her only child admitted to the school.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/e/l/w/Lyall-D-Elwin/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-1069.html and http://www.kempfamilyhistory.com/getperson.php?personID=I74989&tree=adkemp have her as the daughter of Benjamin Vaughton and Mary and he
2 CONC r sibling as Benjamin.
2 CONT
2 CONT The above is suspect as we know for certain that she had a brother called Thomas (not Benjamin) who collected her son Thomas Latham from Christ's Hospital School when he graduated.  
