2 CONC nline] shows daughter Ann Latham's baptism at St Marylebone 1810; Ancestry.com, England and Wales Christening Records, 1530-1916 [database online]. Two other children are drawn from their marriage records, Ancestry.com, England an
2 CONC d Wales, Marriages and Banns, 1538-1940 [database online] [database online] (Catharina) and Ancestry.com, London, England, Marriages and Banns, 1754-1921 (William Williamson) [databases online]; National Probate Calendar 1859 (whi
2 CONC ch included Jacob as another son and executor).
2 CONT
