1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lt.-Col. Duncan Darroch, 6th of Gourock''' *** Elsewhere 5th***
2 CONT * Born on 9 February 1868.
2 CONT * Son of Duncan Darroch, 5th of Gourock and of Torridon and Ann Rickman.
2 CONT * Married Elizabeth Mabws Boughey, daughter of Colonel George Fletcher Ottley Boughey and Harriet Rose Amy Stuart-Menteth, on 1 October 1898.
2 CONT * Died on 22 May 1923 at age 55.
2 CONT * Educated at Harrow School, Harrow on the Hill, London, England.
2 CONT * Retired from the military in 1910, with the rank of Major, late of the Argyll and Sutherland Highalnders.
2 CONT * Fought in the First World War, in Gallipoli and Sinai.
2 CONT * Lieutenant-Colonel in the service of the Territorial Forces Reserve.
2 CONT * Deputy Lieutenant (D.L.) of Renfrewshire. '''Children of Lt.-Col. Duncan Darroch, 6th of Gourock and Elizabeth Mabws Boughey'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Lt.-Col. Duncan Darroch, 7th of Gourock b. 6 Nov 1899, d. 27 Dec 1960
2 CONT * Margaret Elisabeth Darroch b. 7 Mar 1901
2 CONT * Ronald George Darroch b. 7 May 1904, d. 10 Apr 1957
2 CONT * Sheila Mary Susan Darroch b. 15 Jul 1907, d. 22 Jul 1993
2 CONT * Katharine Marion Darroch b. 29 May 1912, d. 13 Jul 1999<br/>
2 CONT [http://thepeerage.com/p17471.htm#i174702 LOTFWW]<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT See also http://darroch.org/darroch_gourock.html
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Two LOTFWW pages<br/>
2 CONT https://livesofthefirstworldwar.org/lifestory/1097682<br/>
2 CONT and <br/>
2 CONT https://livesofthefirstworldwar.org/lifestory/1097681<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
